    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that CMIP5 models which accurately simulate current Antarctic snowfall, when evaluated against CloudSat data, project a larger future precipitation increase and greater moderation of sea-level rise, suggesting the full model ensemble underestimates this contribution.",
